flowchart LR
  S[Supplied S3 dataset<br/>October 1 JSON Lines] --> P[Python producer<br/>receivedAt replay<br/>invoiceId key]
  P --> K[Kinesis Data Streams<br/>1 provisioned shard<br/>eu-north-1]
  K --> F[Amazon Data Firehose<br/>JSON Lines, 60s buffer hint]
  F --> L[S3 private lab bucket<br/>stream/ prefix]
  L --> A[Athena + Glue Data Catalog<br/>dedup SQL and failure rate]
  K --> W[Lambda<br/>60s insertion-time windows<br/>terminal failure rate > 10%]
  W --> N[SNS topic<br/>no external subscribers in lab]
  L --> R[Cloud evidence retained]
  A --> R
  N --> C[CloudWatch log<br/>SNS message IDs]
